  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose is to ensure more inclusive, effective and relevant learning by leveraging technologies and digital innovations and empower learners with digital competencies, including MIL. To address the impact of the COVID-19 pandemic on education and learning as well as strengthen the learning quality, UNESCO Almaty will continue supporting the countries in the region by strengthening the national capacities for leveraging technologies and digital innovations in Central Asia to ensure more inclusive, effective and relevant learning.</narrative>
